      "body": "Hi Arnak,\n\nFollowing the document-workflow example I sent, I wanted to share a short article on moving from an individual AI shortcut to a team-wide improvement.\n\nThe key is making useful methods and corrections part of a shared process, rather than leaving them with the person who discovered them. That's guiding our work at Possible Minds.\n\nhttps://getpossibleminds.com/t/usUx4Kn01A\n\nAt Azaryan Law, would the bigger challenge be finding a useful tool or getting the team to adopt a shared process? I'd appreciate your take.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
